# Theia AQP integration rule

When touching AQP integration surfaces:

1. Treat `theia-extensions/aqp/README.md` as the canonical runbook.
2. Keep browser-target scope explicit unless electron wiring is intentionally
   added.
3. Keep Auth0/AQP endpoint docs path-accurate and avoid stale script names.
4. Use `docs/aqp-monorepo-paths.md` for AQP path references; never hardcode
   local absolute paths.
5. Prefer Tavily-backed research for external Auth0/Theia API guidance, then
   run a docs reliability review before finalizing docs changes.
